---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';

const title = "About, methodology and who pays for this | agentwrotethis.dev";
const description = "What agentwrotethis.dev is, how claims about review tools get verified, and who maintains the site.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
	<section class="max-w-3xl">
		<h1 class="rubric mb-5">
			About this site
		</h1>
		<h2 class="text-3xl font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-zinc-50 mb-8 tracking-tight">
			Who writes this,<br/>and who pays for it.
		</h2>

		<div class="prose dark:prose-invert prose-stone max-w-none prose-lg prose-headings:font-semibold prose-a:text-coral-600 dark:prose-a:text-coral-400 prose-a:underline-offset-4 prose-p:text-pretty prose-p:leading-relaxed">
			<p>
				This site covers one question: <strong>what has to change in review once agents write most of the code?</strong> Generation got fast. The work of deciding whether a change is correct moved downstream and landed on the people who understand the system. That is the subject.
			</p>

			<h3>How claims get checked</h3>
			<p>
				Claims about a tool or a team are read from the primary source, the vendor's own docs or the post itself, and linked so you can check them. When something cannot be confirmed from a primary source, the page says unknown rather than guessing. Benchmark numbers published by a vendor are attributed to that vendor and labelled as theirs.
			</p>
			<p>
				There are no star ratings here. Prices move every month, so a page that is more than a few weeks past its last-verified date should be treated as stale, and you should click through to the source.
			</p>

			<h3>Funding</h3>
			<p>
				Sponsored by <a href="https://kodus.io" rel="noopener">Kodus</a>, who make an open source code reviewer. Their product is held to the same rule as anything else named here: the claim links to the source, and it gets an honest "unknown" where their own docs do not back it. Read accordingly, and check the work. The site is <a href="https://github.com/kodustech/agentwrotethis" rel="noopener">open source</a>.
			</p>

			<h3>Corrections</h3>
			<p>
				Found a stale price or a claim that is wrong? <a href="https://github.com/kodustech/agentwrotethis/issues" rel="noopener">Open an issue</a>. Corrections ship quickly and every page shows when it was last verified.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
